OL,3,GNEWSAI brushed off my sore throat as a
OL,4,Ahangover, but it turned into sepsis
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Elle Black woke up the morning
OL,7,Fafter a night out in February 2024, she
OL,8,Ffelt dreadful.
OL,10,FThe 21-year-old, who was in her first
OL,11,Fyear at Cardiff University, believed
OL,12,Fher sore throat and flu-like symptoms
OL,13,Fwere a hangover and initially "brushed
OL,14,Fit off".
OL,16,FBut the following day she was being
OL,17,Ftreated in hospital for sepsis, a
OL,18,Fserious reaction to an infection which
OL,19,Fcan be life-threatening. Doctors told
OL,20,Fher if she had waited another day
OL,21,Fthings could have been "quite
OL,22,Fdifferent".
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
